  "description": "A cheerful yet temperamental kunoichi. Mai's investigation into the mysterious invitation led her to places and parts unknown. From deserts to swamps, mountains to abandoned cities, each discovery only held more questions that she could not answer. At last, it was in an abandoned strip-mining facility that she finally found the gate mentioned in the invitation. Approaching it, she thought she heard the phantom cry of her beloved, and thus leapt in without a second thought. It was only when the tendrils of madness started to choke her unwary mind that she realized her mistake.",
